        "id": 3594307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-05T08:05:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`can_perform_` name struck me as a validator, which made me unsure about putting a behavior that could possibly be considered a side effect (creates files and exits silently).\n\nI opted for explicitly communicating that this behavior is deliberate in initial patch set, but I do not have strong preference.",
      "parentUuid": "e1d15d2b_c8755d09",
      "revId": "b935acd4247a2bfa9494a55b12d9191837345ddf",
